# STATE

Read this file before any work in this repository and update it in the same PR as the work.
The PR evidence check fails when STATE.md exists and a PR neither updates it nor says
"no change" with a reason. Keep it under 60 lines; facts only, each with a date or SHA.

## Repository

- Type and lifecycle: <software | firmware | hardware | interface | ui | documentation | manifest | release | governance>, <incubating | active | maintenance | deprecated>
- Readiness: <R0 | R1 | R2> (evidence: <link to CI run or verification artifact>)
- Owner role: <role in maintainers.yaml>
- Verification: `<command>`; last PASS on main at <SHA> (<date>)

